.tabbar
  :global(.ant-tabs-nav)
    --ant-tabs-horizontal-margin 0

  // 页签本身上方两个角的圆角：antd 只对 editable-card + small + top 这一组合设了 2px，
  // 且选择器是 .ant-tabs-card.ant-tabs-small.ant-tabs-top > .ant-tabs-nav .ant-tabs-tab，权重高；
  // 这里照抄它的类名、外层再套 .tabbar，靠多一层类把权重压过去。下方两角保持直角。
  // / Top corners of each tab: antd only sets 2px for the editable-card + small + top combination,
  // via .ant-tabs-card.ant-tabs-small.ant-tabs-top > .ant-tabs-nav .ant-tabs-tab, which is highly
  // specific. Mirror its class names under an extra .tabbar scope to win the cascade; the bottom
  // corners stay square.
  :global
    .ant-tabs-card.ant-tabs-small.ant-tabs-top
      .ant-tabs-nav
        &:before
          --ant-color-border-secondary var(--jjext-color-divider)

        .ant-tabs-tab
          // --ant-border-radius 8px
          border-radius 0 16px 0 0
